Despite the target being his bits, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> actually seems to be having fun. It seems making his cage seem normal and almost like a game has calmed the boy’s nerves and the four of you enjoy the rest of your time together. You have no idea if this was <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>’s plan all along or just a happy accident, but it does lead you all feeling much closer and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> seems pretty happy to have more people to share his secret with.</span><br>
<<socialChange "Felix" 5>>
<<socialChange "Manuel" 5 1>>
<<socialChange "Shinju" 5 1>>
<<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
<<needChange "Fun" 40>>
